Comment: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:56.17,ED01_CN,verse,0,0,0,karaoke,仰望蓝天
Comment: 0,0:21:56.17,0:22:03.18,ED01_CN,verse,0,0,0,karaoke,你的声音  回荡不已
Comment: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:08.93,ED01_CN,verse outdent,0,0,0,karaoke,「你并不孤单」话语如此温暖
Comment: 0,0:22:08.93,0:22:15.90,ED01_CN,verse,0,0,0,karaoke,心中却不由得隐隐作痛
Comment: 0,0:22:15.90,0:22:25.53,ED01_CN,verse,0,0,0,karaoke,甚至无暇  去感受开心
Comment: 0,0:22:25.53,0:22:30.87,ED01_CN,verse,0,0,0,karaoke,转瞬即逝的时间
Comment: 0,0:22:30.87,0:22:37.46,ED01_CN,verse,0,0,0,karaoke,只想和你在一起
Comment: 0,0:22:37.46,0:22:40.30,ED01_CN,chorus chorus1,0,0,0,karaoke,眼前的是现实
Comment: 0,0:22:40.30,0:22:43.43,ED01_CN,chorus chorus1,0,0,0,karaoke,这全都是现实
Comment: 0,0:22:43.43,0:22:48.64,ED01_CN,chorus chorus1,0,0,0,karaoke,你在身边洋溢着耀眼的笑容
Comment: 0,0:22:48.64,0:22:51.47,ED01_CN,chorus chorus2,0,0,0,karaoke,如此幸福的光景
Comment: 0,0:22:51.47,0:22:54.60,ED01_CN,chorus chorus2,0,0,0,karaoke,真想持续到永远
Comment: 0,0:22:54.60,0:23:00.36,ED01_CN,chorus chorus2,0,0,0,karaoke,唯独有你陪伴的这个瞬间
Comment: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:09.62,ED01_CN,chorus,0,0,0,karaoke,{=3}全是毋庸置疑千真万确的现实
Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,~Dialogue~
Dialogue: 9,0:00:01.77,0:00:06.24,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,在这一天  我遇到了难以忘怀的一生挚友
Dialogue: 8,0:00:01.77,0:00:06.24,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,この日　忘れられない一生の友達と出会った
Dialogue: 9,0:00:07.49,0:00:11.12,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,自那天以来  地球上有时晴天也会下雪
Dialogue: 8,0:00:07.49,0:00:11.12,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,あの日から　地球は晴れても雪が降るようになった
Dialogue: 9,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.70,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我们早已见怪不怪了
Dialogue: 8,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.70,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分たちにとってそれが日常になった
Dialogue: 9,0:00:16.87,0:00:18.71,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,突然好冷啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:16.87,0:00:18.71,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,いきなりさっむ！
Dialogue: 9,0:00:18.71,0:00:20.38,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,现在不是春天吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:00:18.71,0:00:20.38,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,今さ春のはずじゃん？
Dialogue: 9,0:00:20.38,0:00:22.21,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,太  太冷了！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:20.38,0:00:22.21,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,さ　さぶすぎますよ～！
Dialogue: 9,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.21,Text - CN,Erika,800,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 8,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.21,Text - JP,Erika,800,0,0,,そうね
Dialogue: 9,0:00:22.59,0:00:25.71,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,季节和天气都乱套了啊
Dialogue: 8,0:00:22.59,0:00:25.71,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,季節も天気もめちゃくちゃになっちゃったもんね
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.71,0:00:28.22,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,楠姐  放我下来！
Dialogue: 8,0:00:25.71,0:00:28.22,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,えりねえ　降ろせ～！
Dialogue: 9,0:00:28.22,0:00:30.22,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,哎  真淘气呢
Dialogue: 8,0:00:28.22,0:00:30.22,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,まぁ　おてんばさん
Dialogue: 9,0:00:30.22,0:00:32.47,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,不用担心我
Dialogue: 8,0:00:30.22,0:00:32.47,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃん　いいのよいいのよ
Dialogue: 9,0:00:32.47,0:00:35.10,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,我知道你累 了
Dialogue: 8,0:00:32.47,0:00:35.10,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,ひなちゃん疲れてるのわかってるもの
Dialogue: 9,0:00:35.97,0:00:38.77,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,季节和天气都乱套了…
Dialogue: 8,0:00:35.97,0:00:38.77,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,季節も天気もめちゃくちゃ…
Comment: 9,0:00:39.35,0:00:42.94,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,这天气也是(狂猎,Wild Hunt)造成的吧？
Dialogue: 9,0:00:39.35,0:00:42.94,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,这天气也是狂猎造成的吧？
Dialogue: 9,0:00:39.35,0:00:42.94,RUBY,Renge,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(959,965)}Wild Hunt
Dialogue: 8,0:00:39.35,0:00:42.94,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,この天気もワイルドハントのせいなんですよね
Dialogue: 9,0:00:42.94,0:00:44.77,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,至少是有关系的
Dialogue: 8,0:00:42.94,0:00:44.77,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,関連はしてるんだろう
Dialogue: 9,0:00:45.23,0:00:47.61,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,可能是有气象武器类型的…
Dialogue: 8,0:00:45.23,0:00:47.61,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,気象兵器的なヤツがいるのか…
Dialogue: 9,0:00:47.94,0:00:50.66,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,看样子不是我们能解决的
Dialogue: 8,0:00:47.94,0:00:50.66,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,どうにかできるところにはいなさそうだ
Dialogue: 9,0:00:52.45,0:00:55.58,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,低气温很快就会夺走体力
Dialogue: 8,0:00:52.45,0:00:55.58,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,気温の低下は体力マジ奪うからさ～
Dialogue: 9,0:00:55.58,0:00:58.04,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你还是那么熟悉户外运动啊
Dialogue: 8,0:00:55.58,0:00:58.04,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,相変わらずアウトドアに詳しいな
Dialogue: 9,0:00:58.04,0:01:01.58,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,小  小梅  你平时有去登山什么的吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:00:58.04,0:01:01.58,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,さ　さんちゃん　山とかに行くんですか？
Dialogue: 9,0:01:01.58,0:01:04.17,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,是啊！超赞的好吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:01.58,0:01:04.17,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ！エモくてヤベえから！
Dialogue: 9,0:01:05.80,0:01:09.38,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长  我们今天早点休息吧
Dialogue: 8,0:01:05.80,0:01:09.38,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長　早めに休んだほうがいいと思うし～
Dialogue: 9,0:01:09.38,0:01:10.93,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我要 buff
Dialogue: 8,0:01:09.38,0:01:10.93,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,バフ入れる
Dialogue: 9,0:01:10.93,0:01:14.30,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,嗯  本想多走一段距离的
Dialogue: 8,0:01:10.93,0:01:14.30,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,うむ　もう少し先へ進みたかったが
Dialogue: 9,0:01:14.30,0:01:15.85,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,但是太阳也快落山了
Dialogue: 8,0:01:14.30,0:01:15.85,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,じきに日が落ちるし
Dialogue: 9,0:01:16.14,0:01:19.68,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,不能过多消耗体力… 么
Dialogue: 8,0:01:16.14,0:01:19.68,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,必要以上に消耗するわけにはいかない… か
Dialogue: 9,0:01:21.81,0:01:24.90,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,小  小鸢… 去这里怎么样？
Dialogue: 8,0:01:21.81,0:01:24.90,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あ　あやちゃん…　ここどうですか？
Dialogue: 9,0:01:30.03,0:01:32.41,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,这是学校啊…
Dialogue: 8,0:01:30.03,0:01:32.41,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ　学校じゃん…
Dialogue: 9,0:01:35.45,0:01:36.45,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,哎呀呀
Dialogue: 8,0:01:35.45,0:01:36.45,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,あらまあ
Dialogue: 9,0:01:36.45,0:01:37.99,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,这是烹饪教室啊
Dialogue: 8,0:01:36.45,0:01:37.99,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,調理実習室ね
Dialogue: 9,0:01:40.46,0:01:45.42,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,Citron 拍的照片里也有这所学校啊
Dialogue: 8,0:01:40.46,0:01:45.42,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,この学校もしとろんさんの写真に写っていたところですよね
Dialogue: 9,0:01:46.50,0:01:49.09,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,学校的房间足够大
Dialogue: 8,0:01:46.50,0:01:49.09,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,学校なら広い部屋で休めますし
Dialogue: 9,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.59,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,再加上…
Dialogue: 8,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.59,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,それに…
Dialogue: 9,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.30,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我想到这里可以做割烹…
Dialogue: 8,0:01:51.30,0:01:54.30,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹もできると思って…
Dialogue: 9,0:01:54.30,0:01:55.47,Text - CN,All,0,0,0,,怪不得！
Dialogue: 8,0:01:54.30,0:01:55.47,Text - JP,All,0,0,0,,それか！
Dialogue: 9,0:01:55.47,0:01:57.01,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀…
Dialogue: 8,0:01:55.47,0:01:57.01,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,あらあら…
Dialogue: 9,0:03:30.94,0:03:32.65,Text - CN,Erika,0,1000,0,,真暖和
Dialogue: 8,0:03:30.94,0:03:32.65,Text - JP,Erika,0,1000,0,,あったか～い
Dialogue: 9,0:03:33.07,0:03:35.36,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,这里也通着电
Dialogue: 8,0:03:33.07,0:03:35.36,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ここも電気が生きてる
Dialogue: 9,0:03:35.36,0:03:37.36,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,是 Rat 在维护吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:03:35.36,0:03:37.36,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ラットが手入れしてるのか？
Dialogue: 9,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.37,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.37,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹！
Dialogue: 9,0:03:39.74,0:03:41.87,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,感觉能做出丰盛的饭菜！
Dialogue: 8,0:03:39.74,0:03:41.87,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,豊富な割烹ができそう！
Dialogue: 9,0:03:42.33,0:03:45.00,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,看来今晚得在这里过夜了
Dialogue: 8,0:03:42.33,0:03:45.00,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,今日はここにとどまるしかないか
Dialogue: 9,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.33,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,这么赞  挺好的嘛
Dialogue: 8,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.33,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジエモくていいじゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:03:48.67,0:03:50.54,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,小雏  你没事吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:03:48.67,0:03:50.54,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,ひなちゃん　大丈夫？
Dialogue: 9,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.05,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,没事  我有 buff
Dialogue: 8,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.05,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,べつに　バフあるし
Dialogue: 9,0:03:54.59,0:03:56.22,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,学校么…
Dialogue: 8,0:03:54.59,0:03:56.22,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,学校か…
Dialogue: 9,0:03:56.22,0:03:58.38,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,没想到我还会再来这里
Dialogue: 8,0:03:56.22,0:03:58.38,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,また来るとは思わなかった
Dialogue: 9,0:03:59.84,0:04:01.14,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,对了！
Dialogue: 8,0:03:59.84,0:04:01.14,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,あっ！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:01.14,0:04:02.93,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,你们的衣服有没有破掉？
Dialogue: 8,0:04:01.14,0:04:02.93,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,そうだ　傷んでる服とかない？
Dialogue: 9,0:04:02.93,0:04:05.06,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,我来帮忙补上
Dialogue: 8,0:04:02.93,0:04:05.06,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,繕ったりするわ
Dialogue: 9,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.60,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,多谢了  总是麻烦你
Dialogue: 8,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.60,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,いつも　すまないな
Dialogue: 9,0:04:06.98,0:04:08.60,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,怎么又轻易许诺
Dialogue: 8,0:04:06.98,0:04:08.60,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,また安請け合い
Dialogue: 9,0:04:10.81,0:04:13.27,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长？你在烦恼什么吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:04:10.81,0:04:13.27,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長？何か困ってる？
Dialogue: 9,0:04:13.27,0:04:16.03,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我们的食物不太够
Dialogue: 8,0:04:13.27,0:04:16.03,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,持っている食料が心もとない
Dialogue: 9,0:04:17.45,0:04:19.41,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,等明天天气好转后
Dialogue: 8,0:04:17.45,0:04:19.41,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,明日　天候が回復したら
Dialogue: 9,0:04:19.41,0:04:21.78,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,要去能找到食物的地方
Dialogue: 8,0:04:19.41,0:04:21.78,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,調達できる場所に向かうことにする
Dialogue: 9,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.33,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,OK 哟！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.33,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,オケマル！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:23.33,0:04:26.29,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我们能带的东西就那么多啊
Dialogue: 8,0:04:23.33,0:04:26.29,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,持ち歩ける量限られてるかんな～
Dialogue: 9,0:04:31.00,0:04:33.67,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,好了  今天就在学校过夜！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:31.00,0:04:33.67,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,じゃあ　今日は学校お泊まり！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:33.67,0:04:34.88,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,超赞的！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:33.67,0:04:34.88,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジエモい！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.55,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,哎呀  真棒
Dialogue: 8,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.55,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,まあ　すてき
Dialogue: 9,0:04:36.55,0:04:38.01,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,像集训一样
Dialogue: 8,0:04:36.55,0:04:38.01,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,合宿みたい
Dialogue: 9,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.72,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,大家走了这么远  应该也累了
Dialogue: 8,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.72,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,長い距離を移動して　疲れているだろう
Dialogue: 9,0:04:42.05,0:04:43.97,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,可以先准备睡觉…
Dialogue: 8,0:04:42.05,0:04:43.97,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,もう休む準備をして…
Dialogue: 9,0:04:45.06,0:04:47.39,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,故  故  故障!?停电!?
Dialogue: 8,0:04:45.06,0:04:47.39,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,こ　こ… 故障!?停電!?
Comment: 9,0:04:47.39,0:04:48.94,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,是(狂猎,Wild Hunt)吗？
Dialogue: 9,0:04:47.39,0:04:48.94,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,是狂猎吗？
Dialogue: 9,0:04:47.39,0:04:48.94,RUBY,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(932,965)}Wild Hunt
Dialogue: 8,0:04:47.39,0:04:48.94,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ワイルドハントか？
Dialogue: 9,0:04:49.27,0:04:50.60,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,是我啦！
Dialogue: 8,0:04:49.27,0:04:50.60,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチ　ウチ！
Dialogue: 9,0:04:51.19,0:04:52.81,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你搞什么啊  茶梅？
Dialogue: 8,0:04:51.19,0:04:52.81,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,何のつもりだ　さざんか？
Dialogue: 9,0:04:55.86,0:04:58.86,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,这种时候  还是得讲鬼故事才行
Dialogue: 8,0:04:55.86,0:04:58.86,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,やっぱこういうときは　マジ怪談でしょう
Dialogue: 9,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.57,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,呀  鬼故事？
Dialogue: 8,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.57,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,まあ　怪談？
Dialogue: 9,0:05:01.57,0:05:02.82,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,好哦好哦
Dialogue: 8,0:05:01.57,0:05:02.82,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,いいわね　いいわね
Dialogue: 9,0:05:02.82,0:05:04.70,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,别闹了  先把灯打开
Dialogue: 8,0:05:02.82,0:05:04.70,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,いいから　電気をつけろ
Dialogue: 9,0:05:05.12,0:05:09.16,Text - CN,Sazanka,600,0,0,,那是我和交好的同学去山里时遭遇的事
Dialogue: 8,0:05:05.12,0:05:09.16,Text - JP,Sazanka,600,0,0,,あれは学校の友達と山に行ったときのこと
Dialogue: 9,0:05:07.58,0:05:08.91,Text - CN,Ayame,0,1200,0,,有罪！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:07.58,0:05:08.91,Text - JP,Ayame,0,1200,0,,ギルティ！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:09.16,0:05:11.87,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,茶梅  不要擅自开始讲啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:09.16,0:05:11.87,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,さざんか　勝手に始めるな！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:12.42,0:05:16.21,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我们在河边烤肉时  突然下起了暴雨
Dialogue: 8,0:05:12.42,0:05:16.21,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,川でバーベキューしてたら　雨が降り始めて
Dialogue: 9,0:05:16.63,0:05:20.01,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,于是我们立刻就移动到高处
Dialogue: 8,0:05:16.63,0:05:20.01,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,だからすぐ高い場所に移動したわけ
Dialogue: 9,0:05:20.01,0:05:22.47,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,然后雨一下就停了
Dialogue: 8,0:05:20.01,0:05:22.47,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,そしたらマジですぐ雨やんで
Dialogue: 9,0:05:22.47,0:05:25.76,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我们就继续烤肉  吃得超饱的
Dialogue: 8,0:05:22.47,0:05:25.76,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,その場でバーベキュー再開して　いっぱい食べたんだ～
Dialogue: 9,0:05:27.72,0:05:29.18,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,诶？怎么了？
Dialogue: 8,0:05:27.72,0:05:29.18,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,えっ？あれ？
Dialogue: 9,0:05:29.81,0:05:31.85,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,可怕的部分呢？
Dialogue: 8,0:05:29.81,0:05:31.85,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,いや　怖い話は？
Dialogue: 9,0:05:32.77,0:05:35.48,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,暴洪超可怕的啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:32.77,0:05:35.48,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,鉄砲水とか超こえ～じゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:35.48,0:05:38.40,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,这只是你们去烤肉的故事吧
Dialogue: 8,0:05:35.48,0:05:38.40,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,それはバーベキューをした話だろう
Dialogue: 9,0:05:39.61,0:05:42.49,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,但是我又看不见鬼魂
Dialogue: 8,0:05:39.61,0:05:42.49,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,でも　ウチ　マジで霊感とかないし
Dialogue: 9,0:05:42.49,0:05:44.70,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我  我觉得很可怕啊
Dialogue: 8,0:05:42.49,0:05:44.70,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,わ　私怖かったです
Dialogue: 9,0:05:45.49,0:05:48.20,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,怕吃不上烤肉了
Dialogue: 8,0:05:45.49,0:05:48.20,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,バーベキュー食べられないかと思って
Dialogue: 9,0:05:48.20,0:05:50.50,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,你 buff 上太多了
Dialogue: 8,0:05:48.20,0:05:50.50,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,バフ入れすぎなんだよ
Dialogue: 9,0:05:52.29,0:05:55.25,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,那楠姐和阿雏有什么好故事吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:05:52.29,0:05:55.25,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,じゃあさ　えりねえとひなぴは何かねえの？
Dialogue: 9,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.29,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,超可怕的那种！
Dialogue: 8,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.29,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジヤベえやつ！
Dialogue: 9,0:05:56.29,0:05:58.05,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,好哦好哦
Dialogue: 8,0:05:56.29,0:05:58.05,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,いいわよ　いいわよ
Dialogue: 9,0:05:58.05,0:06:00.09,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,大姐姐的人生智慧
Dialogue: 8,0:05:58.05,0:06:00.09,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃんの知恵袋
Dialogue: 9,0:06:00.38,0:06:02.34,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,当你膝盖疼痛难忍时
Dialogue: 8,0:06:00.38,0:06:02.34,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,激しい膝の痛み
Dialogue: 9,0:06:02.34,0:06:05.09,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,膝关节到底是发生了什么…
Dialogue: 8,0:06:02.34,0:06:05.09,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,そのとき　膝はどうなっているのか
Dialogue: 9,0:06:05.51,0:06:08.26,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,当膝关节软骨磨损的时候…
Dialogue: 8,0:06:05.51,0:06:08.26,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,膝の軟骨がすり減っている場合が…
Dialogue: 9,0:06:08.26,0:06:10.22,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,那是让人疼痛的故事
Dialogue: 8,0:06:08.26,0:06:10.22,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,それは痛い話
Dialogue: 9,0:06:11.35,0:06:14.19,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我就讲讲在网上喷游戏对手
Dialogue: 8,0:06:11.35,0:06:14.19,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ネットで対戦した相手をあおっていたら
Dialogue: 9,0:06:14.19,0:06:18.52,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,被他用社交网站上的照片找出了住处的故事吧
Dialogue: 8,0:06:14.19,0:06:18.52,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,SNS の写真から自宅を特定されたてんまつ
Dialogue: 9,0:06:19.86,0:06:22.53,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,那  那是另外一种可怕了
Dialogue: 8,0:06:19.86,0:06:22.53,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,そ　それは　別方向に怖い話だ
Dialogue: 9,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.45,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,期待期待！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:24.20,0:06:25.45,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ワクワク！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:25.99,0:06:28.53,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我  我没有记忆啦…
Dialogue: 8,0:06:25.99,0:06:28.53,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,き　記憶ないですから…
Dialogue: 9,0:06:28.53,0:06:29.66,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,怎么了怎么了!?
Dialogue: 8,0:06:28.53,0:06:29.66,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,なになに!?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:29.66,0:06:33.12,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,要是我能记得的只有鬼故事  那不是超可怕的？
Dialogue: 8,0:06:29.66,0:06:33.12,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,怪談の記憶だけあったら　すごく怖くないですか？
Dialogue: 9,0:06:33.12,0:06:34.54,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,就是说啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:06:33.12,0:06:34.54,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジそれな！
Dialogue: 9,0:06:35.21,0:06:38.04,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,那要不来讲讲学校里的开心事？
Dialogue: 8,0:06:35.21,0:06:38.04,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,じゃあ　学校の楽しかった話とかする？
Dialogue: 9,0:06:38.04,0:06:41.05,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,不要若无其事地改变话题啊
Dialogue: 8,0:06:38.04,0:06:41.05,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,何事もなかったかのように話題を変えるな
Dialogue: 9,0:06:41.42,0:06:44.26,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我们是上的同一所学校
Dialogue: 8,0:06:41.42,0:06:44.26,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチと委員長は同じ学校だったけど
Dialogue: 9,0:06:44.26,0:06:45.89,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,但其他人不是啊
Dialogue: 8,0:06:44.26,0:06:45.89,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,みんなは違うじゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:06:45.89,0:06:47.80,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真想听听大家的故事
Dialogue: 8,0:06:45.89,0:06:47.80,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ聞いてみたいなって
Dialogue: 9,0:06:47.80,0:06:49.60,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: 8,0:06:47.80,0:06:49.60,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,そうね～
Dialogue: 9,0:06:49.60,0:06:52.48,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,我总是忙着社团活动啊
Dialogue: 8,0:06:49.60,0:06:52.48,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃんは部活ばっかりだったわね
Dialogue: 9,0:06:52.48,0:06:54.39,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我没去上学
Dialogue: 8,0:06:52.48,0:06:54.39,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ひなは行ってなかった
Dialogue: 9,0:06:54.69,0:06:56.06,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,是  是吗!?
Dialogue: 8,0:06:54.69,0:06:56.06,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,そ　そうなん!?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:56.06,0:06:57.27,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真是对不起…
Dialogue: 8,0:06:56.06,0:06:57.27,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジごめん…
Dialogue: 9,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.19,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 8,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.19,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,べつに
Dialogue: 9,0:06:58.19,0:07:00.48,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我也不是被欺凌什么的
Dialogue: 8,0:06:58.19,0:07:00.48,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,いじめられてたとかじゃないから
Dialogue: 9,0:07:00.48,0:07:05.11,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我  我的话  还  还是什么都想不起来
Dialogue: 8,0:07:00.48,0:07:05.11,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,わ　私は　や　やっぱり覚えてないです…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:05.11,0:07:08.16,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我也没什么值得一提的
Dialogue: 8,0:07:05.11,0:07:08.16,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分も特に話すことはない
Dialogue: 9,0:07:08.16,0:07:09.62,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,换做百合的话  她一定…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:08.16,0:07:09.62,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ゆりなら　きっと…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:15.29,0:07:17.38,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,就  就到此为止吧
Dialogue: 8,0:07:15.29,0:07:17.38,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,も　もう終わりにしよう
Dialogue: 9,0:07:18.83,0:07:21.13,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,茶梅  你玩够了吧！
Dialogue: 8,0:07:18.83,0:07:21.13,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,さざんか　いいかげんにしろ！
Dialogue: 9,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.84,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,这次不是我！
Dialogue: 8,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.84,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,これ　ウチじゃねえし！
Dialogue: 9,0:07:23.34,0:07:25.34,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,空调也停了
Dialogue: 8,0:07:23.34,0:07:25.34,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,空調も止まってる
Dialogue: 9,0:07:25.34,0:07:26.68,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,这是真的停电了
Dialogue: 8,0:07:25.34,0:07:26.68,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,普通に停電
Dialogue: 9,0:07:27.05,0:07:28.72,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,可能是下雪的缘故
Dialogue: 8,0:07:27.05,0:07:28.72,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,雪のせいかも
Dialogue: 9,0:07:28.72,0:07:31.22,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,这下糟了  室温很快就会降下来！
Dialogue: 8,0:07:28.72,0:07:31.22,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジヤバい　すぐ室温下がってくる！
Dialogue: 9,0:07:31.22,0:07:33.43,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,Rat 没有维修吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:07:31.22,0:07:33.43,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ラットが修理しないのか？
Dialogue: 9,0:07:33.43,0:07:36.27,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,一般情况下它们就会去修了…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:33.43,0:07:36.27,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,普通ならそうすると思うんだが…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.02,Text - CN,Hinageshi,500,0,0,,可能被大雪困住了
Dialogue: 8,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.02,Text - JP,Hinageshi,500,0,0,,雪で動けないのかも
Dialogue: 9,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.02,Text - CN,Rat,0,1000,0,,啾啾  恢复啾…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.02,Text - JP,Rat,0,1000,0,,チューチュー　復帰チュー…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:39.98,0:07:42.57,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你知道是哪里出了故障吗
Dialogue: 8,0:07:39.98,0:07:42.57,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,障害が出ている場所はわかるか？
Dialogue: 9,0:07:44.94,0:07:45.82,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 8,0:07:44.94,0:07:45.82,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 9,0:07:46.65,0:07:50.07,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,让我调查一下这区域 Rat 的网络…
Dialogue: 8,0:07:46.65,0:07:50.07,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,この辺りのラットのネットワークを調べて…
Dialogue: 9,0:07:50.07,0:07:51.70,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,出现故障的是这里
Dialogue: 8,0:07:50.07,0:07:51.70,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,障害はここ
Dialogue: 9,0:07:52.37,0:07:54.20,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,不是很远啊
Dialogue: 8,0:07:52.37,0:07:54.20,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,それほど遠くないな
Dialogue: 9,0:07:54.62,0:07:56.96,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我去把 Rat 直接带过去
Dialogue: 8,0:07:54.62,0:07:56.96,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分がラットを直接持っていく
Dialogue: 9,0:07:57.75,0:08:01.21,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,只要从雪里脱困  它们就能完成维修吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:07:57.75,0:08:01.21,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,雪に足を取られなければ　修理できるんだろう？
Dialogue: 9,0:08:01.21,0:08:02.46,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我也去！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:01.21,0:08:02.46,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチも！
Dialogue: 9,0:08:02.46,0:08:03.92,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我一个人就行了
Dialogue: 8,0:08:02.46,0:08:03.92,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分だけでいい
Dialogue: 9,0:08:04.51,0:08:07.09,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我的身法最为灵活
Dialogue: 8,0:08:04.51,0:08:07.09,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分がいちばん小回りが利くし
Dialogue: 9,0:08:07.09,0:08:09.97,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,要是遇到埋伏  也能应对
Dialogue: 8,0:08:07.09,0:08:09.97,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,万が一奇襲を受けた場合も　対応できる
Dialogue: 9,0:08:10.34,0:08:12.01,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,要是发生什么事我就立刻回来
Dialogue: 8,0:08:10.34,0:08:12.01,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,何かあればすぐ戻るから
Dialogue: 9,0:08:12.01,0:08:13.81,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你们在这里等我
Dialogue: 8,0:08:12.01,0:08:13.81,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ここで待機してくれ
Dialogue: 9,0:08:18.73,0:08:20.73,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,一下就冷起来了…
Dialogue: 8,0:08:18.73,0:08:20.73,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,早速　冷えてきた…
Comment: 9,0:08:22.52,0:08:25.23,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,(点个篝火吧  还能做复活点,※指魂系列游戏中的篝火)
Dialogue: 9,0:08:22.52,0:08:25.23,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,点个篝火吧  还能做复活点
Dialogue: 9,0:08:22.52,0:08:25.23,RUBY,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(960,965)}※指魂系列游戏中的篝火
Dialogue: 8,0:08:22.52,0:08:25.23,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,かがり火つけて　リスポーンもできる
Dialogue: 9,0:08:25.78,0:08:28.40,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我还是觉得她一个人去太危险了
Dialogue: 8,0:08:25.78,0:08:28.40,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,やっぱり 1 人は危ないと思う
Dialogue: 9,0:08:28.40,0:08:29.57,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,就是说啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:28.40,0:08:29.57,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジそれな！
Dialogue: 9,0:08:29.57,0:08:31.57,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我去看看情况
Dialogue: 8,0:08:29.57,0:08:31.57,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,私　見てきます
Dialogue: 9,0:08:31.57,0:08:32.58,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,你呢？
Dialogue: 8,0:08:31.57,0:08:32.58,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,さんちゃんは？
Dialogue: 9,0:08:32.87,0:08:33.62,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我也去！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:32.87,0:08:33.62,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチも！
Dialogue: 9,0:08:33.62,0:08:35.49,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,小梅  拜托了
Dialogue: 8,0:08:33.62,0:08:35.49,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,さんちゃん　お願いね
Dialogue: 9,0:08:35.49,0:08:38.21,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,要是发生了什么事  要立刻回来哦
Dialogue: 8,0:08:35.49,0:08:38.21,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,何かあれば　すぐ帰ってきてね
Dialogue: 9,0:08:44.63,0:08:46.21,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长
Dialogue: 8,0:08:44.63,0:08:46.21,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長
Dialogue: 9,0:08:47.47,0:08:49.47,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长！
Dialogue: 8,0:08:47.47,0:08:49.47,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長！
Dialogue: 9,0:08:51.26,0:08:53.43,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,你  你没事吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:08:51.26,0:08:53.43,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,だ　大丈夫ですか？
Dialogue: 9,0:08:55.68,0:08:58.48,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我让你担心了？
Dialogue: 8,0:08:55.68,0:08:58.48,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,なんかマジ心配させちゃった？
Dialogue: 9,0:08:58.48,0:09:01.52,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,那个… 有一点…
Dialogue: 8,0:08:58.48,0:09:01.52,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,えっと… 少し…
Dialogue: 9,0:09:01.52,0:09:02.73,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,果然么？
Dialogue: 8,0:09:01.52,0:09:02.73,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,やっぱ？
Dialogue: 9,0:09:03.27,0:09:08.61,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,那个  我感觉你和小鸢有点反常…
Dialogue: 8,0:09:03.27,0:09:08.61,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あの　なんだかちょっとさんちゃんとあやちゃんいつもと違う気がして…
Dialogue: 9,0:09:09.20,0:09:10.32,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 8,0:09:09.20,0:09:10.32,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,あのさ
Dialogue: 9,0:09:10.32,0:09:14.66,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我真的… 不  我有个问题想问问你
Dialogue: 8,0:09:10.32,0:09:14.66,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ…　いや　ちょっとだけ聞きたいことがあんだけど
Dialogue: 9,0:09:17.33,0:09:21.04,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,莲莲  你是怎么看待我和班长的？
Dialogue: 8,0:09:17.33,0:09:21.04,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,れんれんさ　ウチと委員長ってどう思う？
Dialogue: 9,0:09:21.79,0:09:24.21,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,什  什么怎么看？
Dialogue: 8,0:09:21.79,0:09:24.21,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ど　どう思うって…
Dialogue: 9,0:09:24.21,0:09:26.05,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你怎么看!?
Dialogue: 8,0:09:24.21,0:09:26.05,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,どう思う!?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:26.38,0:09:29.22,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,小  小鸢总是靠得住
Dialogue: 8,0:09:26.38,0:09:29.22,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あ　あやちゃんは　いつも頼りになるし
Dialogue: 9,0:09:29.22,0:09:31.30,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,而小梅你又漂亮又可爱
Dialogue: 8,0:09:29.22,0:09:31.30,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,さんちゃんは美人でかわいくて
Dialogue: 9,0:09:31.30,0:09:34.93,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,之前发现你擅长户外活动时我吃了一惊
Dialogue: 8,0:09:31.30,0:09:34.93,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,さっきはアウトドアにも詳しくてビックリしました
Dialogue: 9,0:09:33.55,0:09:36.10,Text - CN - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,不  不是这个
Dialogue: 8,0:09:33.55,0:09:36.10,Text - JP - top,Sazanka,0,0,0,,つ～か　そうじゃなくて！
Dialogue: 9,0:09:39.98,0:09:42.23,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,不  不是这个？
Dialogue: 8,0:09:39.98,0:09:42.23,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,そ　そうじゃなくて？
Dialogue: 9,0:09:42.56,0:09:45.36,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我不是说你说得不对
Dialogue: 8,0:09:42.56,0:09:45.36,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,今のがだめとかマジそうじゃなくて
Dialogue: 9,0:09:45.36,0:09:50.24,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我脑子笨  不知道该怎么说
Dialogue: 8,0:09:45.36,0:09:50.24,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチ頭ヤバいから　何て言えばいいのかわかんないんだよね
Dialogue: 9,0:09:51.03,0:09:53.36,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我真正想问的是
Dialogue: 8,0:09:51.03,0:09:53.36,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ聞きたかったのはさ
Dialogue: 9,0:09:53.36,0:09:56.70,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你  你有觉得最近班长很疲惫吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:09:53.36,0:09:56.70,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,さ　最近　委員長疲れてない？ってことで…
Dialogue: 9,0:09:58.37,0:10:01.58,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我就想  做队长是不是压力太大了
Dialogue: 8,0:09:58.37,0:10:01.58,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,やっぱ　リーダーってマジ大変なのかな～って
Dialogue: 9,0:10:01.58,0:10:06.59,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,你该不会是想问我怎么看你们俩的关系？
Dialogue: 8,0:10:01.58,0:10:06.59,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,もしかして　さんちゃんとあやちゃんの関係をどう思うか… みたいな
Dialogue: 9,0:10:06.59,0:10:08.09,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,就是它！
Dialogue: 8,0:10:06.59,0:10:08.09,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジそれな！
Dialogue: 9,0:10:08.42,0:10:11.84,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,那你是怎么看的呢  我和班长
Dialogue: 8,0:10:08.42,0:10:11.84,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,それでさどうかな？ウチと委員長
Dialogue: 9,0:10:11.84,0:10:15.01,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我觉得你们非常要好
Dialogue: 8,0:10:11.84,0:10:15.01,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,すごく仲よしだと思ってました
Dialogue: 9,0:10:15.01,0:10:18.97,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,看得出来你们是老朋友了  也相互了解
Dialogue: 8,0:10:15.01,0:10:18.97,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ずっと前からのお友達で　お互いのことをわかってるって
Dialogue: 9,0:10:19.31,0:10:20.72,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你说的没错！
Dialogue: 8,0:10:19.31,0:10:20.72,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ合ってる！
Dialogue: 9,0:10:21.14,0:10:24.48,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,但是我不知道是不是真的很要好…
Dialogue: 8,0:10:21.14,0:10:24.48,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,仲がいいのかマジわかんないっていうか…
Dialogue: 9,0:10:24.94,0:10:29.61,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我和她在小学时就认识了
Dialogue: 8,0:10:24.94,0:10:29.61,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチと委員長マジで小学校からのつきあいなんだよね
Dialogue: 9,0:10:29.61,0:10:32.90,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,那时她朋友很多  我一直很向往她
Dialogue: 8,0:10:29.61,0:10:32.90,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長友達多くて　憧れてたんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:10:33.36,0:10:37.28,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,当时我既没有朋友  也不会说话…
Dialogue: 8,0:10:33.36,0:10:37.28,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチ友達いなかったし　話すのも苦手だったし…
Dialogue: 9,0:10:37.28,0:10:37.95,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,诶!?
Dialogue: 8,0:10:37.28,0:10:37.95,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,えっ!?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:37.95,0:10:39.70,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,这跟我的印象完全相反啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:10:37.95,0:10:39.70,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,イメージ逆です！
Dialogue: 9,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.62,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,现在的我可能确实不一样
Dialogue: 8,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.62,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,今からするとそうかも
Dialogue: 9,0:10:41.91,0:10:45.17,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长受大家欢迎  还擅长运动
Dialogue: 8,0:10:41.91,0:10:45.17,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長人気あるし　スポーツもできるからさ～
Dialogue: 9,0:10:45.75,0:10:49.42,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我为了想追赶她  真是下了很多工夫
Dialogue: 8,0:10:45.75,0:10:49.42,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチ追いつきたいなって　マジいろいろやったんだよね
Dialogue: 9,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.71,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我变得开朗了一点  朋友也多了
Dialogue: 8,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.71,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ちょっと明るくなれたし　友達も増えた
Dialogue: 9,0:10:52.01,0:10:53.80,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,这根本不是「一点」吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:10:52.01,0:10:53.80,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ちょっとじゃなくないですか？
Dialogue: 9,0:10:53.80,0:10:55.18,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,完全是社牛啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:10:53.80,0:10:55.18,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,陽キャですよ！
Dialogue: 9,0:10:55.18,0:10:56.84,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,在那之后呢…
Dialogue: 8,0:10:55.18,0:10:56.84,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,そしたらさ…
Dialogue: 9,0:10:56.84,0:11:00.68,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长和我就没怎么说过话了
Dialogue: 8,0:10:56.84,0:11:00.68,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,なんか委員長とあんまり話さなくなっちゃったんだよね
Dialogue: 9,0:11:01.39,0:11:05.56,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,初中的时候  她总是一个人读书…
Dialogue: 8,0:11:01.39,0:11:05.56,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,中学の頃の委員長 1 人で本読んでること多くてさ…
Dialogue: 9,0:11:06.02,0:11:08.94,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,但是  在世界变成这样之后
Dialogue: 8,0:11:06.02,0:11:08.94,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,でも　世界がこんなにヤバくなって
Dialogue: 9,0:11:08.94,0:11:11.40,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,多亏了百合  我和她得以重逢
Dialogue: 8,0:11:08.94,0:11:11.40,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ゆりちのおかげで再会してさ
Dialogue: 9,0:11:11.40,0:11:14.95,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我以为我能像过去一样和她交谈…
Dialogue: 8,0:11:11.40,0:11:14.95,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,前みたく話できてるって思ってたんだけど…
Dialogue: 9,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.03,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,话说…
Dialogue: 8,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.03,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,つ～かさ…
Dialogue: 9,0:11:17.03,0:11:19.95,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,莲莲  你在这种时候会怎么做？
Dialogue: 8,0:11:17.03,0:11:19.95,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,れんれんはさ　こういうときマジどうする？
Dialogue: 9,0:11:20.24,0:11:21.58,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,不  不知道
Dialogue: 8,0:11:20.24,0:11:21.58,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ぜ　全然
Dialogue: 9,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.75,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我会的就只有割烹而已
Dialogue: 8,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.75,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹以外わかりません
Dialogue: 9,0:11:23.75,0:11:25.33,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我什么都不记得了…
Dialogue: 8,0:11:23.75,0:11:25.33,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,何も覚えてないし…
Dialogue: 9,0:11:25.33,0:11:27.21,Text - CN,Yuri,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}气势满满哦！
Dialogue: 8,0:11:25.33,0:11:27.21,Text - JP,Yuri,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}ドンドンドーンだよ！
Dialogue: 9,0:11:28.75,0:11:30.25,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,又来了…
Dialogue: 8,0:11:28.75,0:11:30.25,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,今のまた…
Dialogue: 9,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.63,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,莲莲!?
Dialogue: 8,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.63,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,れんれん!?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:33.63,0:11:35.05,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你当真没事吧!?
Dialogue: 8,0:11:33.63,0:11:35.05,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ大丈夫!?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:35.72,0:11:37.43,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我当真没事！
Dialogue: 8,0:11:35.72,0:11:37.43,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,マジ平気です！
Dialogue: 9,0:11:37.43,0:11:38.68,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,只是发呆了一下
Dialogue: 8,0:11:37.43,0:11:38.68,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,ボーッとしました
Dialogue: 9,0:11:38.68,0:11:40.35,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,刚才真对不起
Dialogue: 8,0:11:38.68,0:11:40.35,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,さっきのごめん
Dialogue: 9,0:11:40.35,0:11:42.22,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,问你你也不知道啊
Dialogue: 8,0:11:40.35,0:11:42.22,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,確かにわかんないよね
Dialogue: 9,0:11:42.56,0:11:44.60,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我才是应该道歉
Dialogue: 8,0:11:42.56,0:11:44.60,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,私こそごめんなさい
Dialogue: 9,0:11:47.48,0:11:49.56,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:11:47.48,0:11:49.56,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹！
Dialogue: 9,0:11:49.56,0:11:52.40,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,割烹!?真不得了  要做什么!?
Dialogue: 8,0:11:49.56,0:11:52.40,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,割烹!?マジヤバイな　どうすんの!?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:52.40,0:11:55.61,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,也许能借割烹展开对话…
Dialogue: 8,0:11:52.40,0:11:55.61,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹をうまく話のきっかけにできれば…
Dialogue: 9,0:11:55.61,0:11:57.74,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你真是天才啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:11:55.61,0:11:57.74,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,れんれんマジ天才！
Dialogue: 9,0:11:57.74,0:11:59.82,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,但是我不会割烹啊
Dialogue: 8,0:11:57.74,0:11:59.82,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,でもウチ割烹マジ無理じゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:12:00.12,0:12:02.20,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我来帮你
Dialogue: 8,0:12:00.12,0:12:02.20,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,私がお手伝いします
Dialogue: 9,0:12:02.20,0:12:03.91,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,你想做什么样的菜？
Dialogue: 8,0:12:02.20,0:12:03.91,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,どんな割烹しますか？
Dialogue: 9,0:12:03.91,0:12:05.16,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 8,0:12:03.91,0:12:05.16,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,それな～
Dialogue: 9,0:12:05.16,0:12:07.79,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,总之先做点能暖身子的
Dialogue: 8,0:12:05.16,0:12:07.79,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,とりま　マジあったかいやつな～
Dialogue: 9,0:12:08.37,0:12:10.42,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,小  小梅…
Dialogue: 8,0:12:08.37,0:12:10.42,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,さ　さんちゃん…
Dialogue: 9,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.22,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,有人在吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.22,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,誰かいる～？
Dialogue: 9,0:12:30.06,0:12:32.02,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,他们是在等人吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:12:30.06,0:12:32.02,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,誰か待ってたのかな？
Comment: 9,0:12:32.77,0:12:37.65,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,就算是有(安德瓦里,Andvari)  去外面也很可怕啊
Dialogue: 9,0:12:32.77,0:12:37.65,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,就算是有安德瓦里  去外面也很可怕啊
Dialogue: 9,0:12:32.77,0:12:37.65,RUBY,Sazanka,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(836,965)}Andvari
Dialogue: 8,0:12:32.77,0:12:37.65,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,アンドヴァリ持ってても　外出るのマジ怖いもんな
Dialogue: 9,0:12:38.03,0:12:39.49,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 8,0:12:38.03,0:12:39.49,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,そうだよ
Comment: 9,0:12:39.49,0:12:42.62,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,就算不是被(狂猎,Wild Hunt)消除  人也是会死的
Dialogue: 9,0:12:39.49,0:12:42.62,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,就算不是被狂猎消除  人也是会死的
Dialogue: 9,0:12:39.49,0:12:42.62,RUBY,Sazanka,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(864,965)}Wild Hunt
Dialogue: 8,0:12:39.49,0:12:42.62,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ワイルドハントに消されなくても　死んじゃうんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:12:43.87,0:12:47.25,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,雪是不是又大了些
Dialogue: 8,0:12:43.87,0:12:47.25,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,雪さっきよりひどくなってませんか？
Dialogue: 9,0:12:49.21,0:12:50.62,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 8,0:12:49.21,0:12:50.62,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジヤバいって
Dialogue: 9,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.34,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,这么下去班长回不来了！
Dialogue: 8,0:12:51.08,0:12:53.34,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,このままじゃ　委員長戻れない！
Dialogue: 9,0:12:54.00,0:12:56.80,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,莲莲  帮忙准备点能暖身子的东西！
Dialogue: 8,0:12:54.00,0:12:56.80,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,れんれん　あったかいもの用意しといて！
Dialogue: 9,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.34,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我去找她！
Dialogue: 8,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.34,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチが捜してくる！
Dialogue: 9,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.34,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,你也会有危险的
Dialogue: 8,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.34,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,さんちゃんも危ないです
Dialogue: 9,0:13:00.34,0:13:02.59,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我擅长户外  不怕！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:00.34,0:13:02.59,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチ　アウトドアでいけるほうだし！
Dialogue: 9,0:13:02.59,0:13:06.10,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,而且我有办法  相信我！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:02.59,0:13:06.10,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,それにマジちゃんと考えあるから　信じて！
Dialogue: 9,0:13:06.43,0:13:07.77,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,但  但是…
Dialogue: 8,0:13:06.43,0:13:07.77,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,で　でも…
Dialogue: 9,0:13:07.77,0:13:09.14,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真的  相信我！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:07.77,0:13:09.14,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ信じて！
Dialogue: 9,0:13:11.60,0:13:13.65,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,哪怕为了割烹也要平安无事啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:11.60,0:13:13.65,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,割烹にかけて　ご無事で！
Dialogue: 9,0:13:14.31,0:13:15.73,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,OK 哟！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:14.31,0:13:15.73,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,オケマル！
Dialogue: 9,0:13:15.73,0:13:17.23,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,为了割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:15.73,0:13:17.23,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,割烹にかけて！
Dialogue: 9,0:13:17.23,0:13:18.32,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,我走了！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:17.23,0:13:18.32,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,行きます！
Dialogue: 9,0:13:21.70,0:13:23.45,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,当真  不要着急
Dialogue: 8,0:13:21.70,0:13:23.45,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ焦んなよ
Dialogue: 9,0:13:23.45,0:13:25.16,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,要泰然自若
Dialogue: 8,0:13:23.45,0:13:25.16,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,泰然自若だ
Dialogue: 9,0:13:29.91,0:13:32.37,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,脚印都消失了
Dialogue: 8,0:13:29.91,0:13:32.37,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,足跡も埋まってるけど
Dialogue: 9,0:13:33.04,0:13:36.67,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,但是我知道她目的地  姑且！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:33.04,0:13:36.67,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,どこに向かったかだけはわかってる　とりま！
Comment: 9,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.42,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,(安德瓦里,Andvari)  展开
Dialogue: 9,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.42,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,安德瓦里  展开
Dialogue: 9,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.42,RUBY,Sazanka,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(892,965)}Andvari
Dialogue: 8,0:13:37.17,0:13:39.42,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,アンドヴァリ・エクステンド！
Dialogue: 9,0:13:40.51,0:13:42.38,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,阿冈  就靠你了！
Dialogue: 8,0:13:40.51,0:13:42.38,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,グングン頼りにしてる！
Dialogue: 9,0:13:54.27,0:13:56.11,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,什么都看不见
Dialogue: 8,0:13:54.27,0:13:56.11,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ見えねえ
Dialogue: 9,0:13:56.11,0:13:58.03,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,但是只有我能帮她了
Dialogue: 8,0:13:56.11,0:13:58.03,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,でもウチしかいない
Dialogue: 9,0:13:58.69,0:14:01.82,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,现在能找到班长的就只有我了
Dialogue: 8,0:13:58.69,0:14:01.82,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,今委員長を見つけられるのはウチだけ
Dialogue: 9,0:14:02.11,0:14:03.99,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:02.11,0:14:03.99,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:09.33,0:14:11.46,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,这是最后一个了…
Dialogue: 8,0:14:09.33,0:14:11.46,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,これで最後…
Dialogue: 9,0:14:11.46,0:14:13.71,Text - CN,Rat,0,0,0,,脱困啾！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:11.46,0:14:13.71,Text - JP,Rat,0,0,0,,脱出チュー！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:14.79,0:14:17.29,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,接下来只需要回去了
Dialogue: 8,0:14:14.79,0:14:17.29,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,あとは戻るだけ…
Dialogue: 9,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.17,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,仅此而已
Dialogue: 8,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.17,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,それだけなのに
Dialogue: 9,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.84,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,明明茶梅有阻止我…
Dialogue: 8,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.84,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,さざんかが止めてくれたのに…
Dialogue: 9,0:14:25.68,0:14:28.01,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,要让大家担心了…
Dialogue: 8,0:14:25.68,0:14:28.01,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,みんなに心配かけてしまう…
Dialogue: 9,0:14:28.47,0:14:30.47,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,这下成大家的累赘了…
Dialogue: 8,0:14:28.47,0:14:30.47,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,これじゃあ足手まといだ…
Dialogue: 9,0:14:31.81,0:14:34.35,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,换成是百合的话  在这种时候…
Dialogue: 8,0:14:31.81,0:14:34.35,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,こんなとき　ゆりなら…
Dialogue: 9,0:14:35.65,0:14:37.65,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:35.65,0:14:37.65,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:39.32,0:14:40.32,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,有声音？
Dialogue: 8,0:14:39.32,0:14:40.32,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,声？
Dialogue: 9,0:14:40.82,0:14:41.82,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,茶梅？
Dialogue: 8,0:14:40.82,0:14:41.82,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,さざんか？
Dialogue: 9,0:14:43.36,0:14:44.45,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,哇  不是吧!?
Dialogue: 8,0:14:43.36,0:14:44.45,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,うわ　マジ!?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:44.74,0:14:46.07,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:44.74,0:14:46.07,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:51.33,0:14:52.58,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,茶梅!?
Dialogue: 8,0:14:51.33,0:14:52.58,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,さざんか!?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:52.58,0:14:53.87,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:52.58,0:14:53.87,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:53.87,0:14:55.67,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真是太好了  你平安无事！
Dialogue: 8,0:14:53.87,0:14:55.67,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジよかった　無事じゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:14:55.67,0:14:56.75,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,Rat 呢？
Dialogue: 8,0:14:55.67,0:14:56.75,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ラットは？
Dialogue: 9,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.25,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我成功让它们脱困了  但是…
Dialogue: 8,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.25,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,そこまではできた　だけど…
Dialogue: 9,0:14:59.25,0:15:00.71,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真是太厉害了
Dialogue: 8,0:14:59.25,0:15:00.71,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジすげえ
Dialogue: 9,0:15:00.71,0:15:02.09,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,不愧是班长！
Dialogue: 8,0:15:00.71,0:15:02.09,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,さすが委員長！
Dialogue: 9,0:15:02.09,0:15:03.17,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,对了  穿上这个
Dialogue: 8,0:15:02.09,0:15:03.17,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,あっ　これ着て
Dialogue: 9,0:15:03.17,0:15:04.01,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 8,0:15:03.17,0:15:04.01,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,うん…
Dialogue: 9,0:15:06.93,0:15:10.06,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,知道方向的话  我们走回去吧
Dialogue: 8,0:15:06.93,0:15:10.06,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,方向がわかるなら　歩いて帰ろう
Dialogue: 9,0:15:10.06,0:15:12.77,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,不行  现在要怎么走
Dialogue: 8,0:15:10.06,0:15:12.77,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,無理　今まともに歩けねえ
Comment: 9,0:15:13.10,0:15:15.14,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,用(冈格尼尔,Gungnir)就行了
Dialogue: 9,0:15:13.10,0:15:15.14,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,用冈格尼尔就行了
Dialogue: 9,0:15:13.10,0:15:15.14,RUBY,Ayame,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(904,965)}Gungnir
Dialogue: 8,0:15:13.10,0:15:15.14,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,グングニルを使えばいい
Dialogue: 9,0:15:15.14,0:15:16.81,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,那也不行
Dialogue: 8,0:15:15.14,0:15:16.81,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,それも無理
Dialogue: 9,0:15:16.81,0:15:19.86,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我没信心让阿冈带两个人
Dialogue: 8,0:15:16.81,0:15:19.86,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,グングンで 2 人まとめて運ぶ自信ねえし
Dialogue: 9,0:15:20.36,0:15:23.65,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,啊  糟糕  我真没想过要怎么回去
Dialogue: 8,0:15:20.36,0:15:23.65,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,あっ　ヤバっ　マジ考えてなかった
Dialogue: 9,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.11,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我说啊
Dialogue: 8,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.11,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,あのな～
Dialogue: 9,0:15:25.65,0:15:29.49,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,平时天气很快就会变化了
Dialogue: 8,0:15:25.65,0:15:29.49,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,いつもどおりならすぐ天気変わるはずなんだけど
Dialogue: 9,0:15:32.29,0:15:34.08,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,话说  我们撑不到那时候吧
Dialogue: 8,0:15:32.29,0:15:34.08,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,てか　ウチらがもたねえか
Dialogue: 9,0:15:37.46,0:15:38.96,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长
Dialogue: 8,0:15:37.46,0:15:38.96,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長
Dialogue: 9,0:15:41.04,0:15:42.38,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,茶梅…
Dialogue: 8,0:15:41.04,0:15:42.38,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,さざんか…
Dialogue: 9,0:15:42.38,0:15:44.80,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,得保持体温啊
Dialogue: 8,0:15:42.38,0:15:44.80,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,体温維持しないとだし
Dialogue: 9,0:15:45.13,0:15:45.80,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 8,0:15:45.13,0:15:45.80,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 9,0:15:53.31,0:15:55.27,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你的体力已经被冻得差不多了
Dialogue: 8,0:15:53.31,0:15:55.27,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,寒さで消耗してるから
Dialogue: 9,0:15:55.27,0:15:56.23,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,这个给你吃
Dialogue: 8,0:15:55.27,0:15:56.23,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,これも
Dialogue: 9,0:16:04.40,0:16:05.69,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长…
Dialogue: 8,0:16:04.40,0:16:05.69,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長…
Dialogue: 9,0:16:05.69,0:16:06.82,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你在哭吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:16:05.69,0:16:06.82,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,泣いてた？
Dialogue: 9,0:16:07.61,0:16:08.49,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 8,0:16:07.61,0:16:08.49,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.53,0:16:11.91,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,因为雪的缘故？
Dialogue: 8,0:16:10.53,0:16:11.91,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,雪のせい？
Dialogue: 9,0:16:16.16,0:16:17.46,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,有罪
Dialogue: 8,0:16:16.16,0:16:17.46,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ギルティ
Dialogue: 9,0:16:17.46,0:16:18.46,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,不要看
Dialogue: 8,0:16:17.46,0:16:18.46,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,見るな
Dialogue: 9,0:16:19.25,0:16:20.54,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,有罪…
Dialogue: 8,0:16:19.25,0:16:20.54,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ギルティ…
Dialogue: 9,0:16:20.88,0:16:23.42,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,可我离得这么近啊
Dialogue: 8,0:16:20.88,0:16:23.42,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ってつっても　マジくっついてるし
Dialogue: 9,0:16:23.71,0:16:26.88,Text - CN,Ayame,800,0,0,,我又没法大家面前哭啊
Dialogue: 8,0:16:23.71,0:16:26.88,Text - JP,Ayame,800,0,0,,みんなの前で泣くわけにいかないだろう
Dialogue: 9,0:16:26.88,0:16:29.05,Text - CN,Ayame,800,0,0,,现在我是队长
Dialogue: 8,0:16:26.88,0:16:29.05,Text - JP,Ayame,800,0,0,,今は自分がリーダーなんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:16:29.76,0:16:31.60,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,会让大家丧失士气的
Dialogue: 8,0:16:29.76,0:16:31.60,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,みんなが不安になる
Dialogue: 9,0:16:33.43,0:16:35.06,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,班长…
Dialogue: 8,0:16:33.43,0:16:35.06,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長…
Dialogue: 9,0:16:35.06,0:16:38.27,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,抱歉  之前我把气氛都破坏了
Dialogue: 8,0:16:35.06,0:16:38.27,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,さっきは空気を悪くして　すまなかった
Dialogue: 9,0:16:38.27,0:16:40.56,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,之前？讲鬼故事的时候？
Dialogue: 8,0:16:38.27,0:16:40.56,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,{*えっ　}さっき？怪談の話？
Dialogue: 9,0:16:40.56,0:16:41.98,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,换做百合的话…
Dialogue: 8,0:16:40.56,0:16:41.98,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ゆりなら…
Dialogue: 9,0:16:41.98,0:16:44.52,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,她一定能炒热气氛的
Dialogue: 8,0:16:41.98,0:16:44.52,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ゆりがいたらちゃんと盛り上がってたと思う
Dialogue: 9,0:16:44.94,0:16:47.11,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,可最后也没能讲成鬼故事啊
Dialogue: 8,0:16:44.94,0:16:47.11,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,てか怪談になってなかったし
Dialogue: 9,0:16:47.11,0:16:49.66,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我这个人太没意思了
Dialogue: 8,0:16:47.11,0:16:49.66,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分がつまらないんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:16:49.66,0:16:51.45,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,总是讲些大道理
Dialogue: 8,0:16:49.66,0:16:51.45,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,いつも正論ばかりで
Dialogue: 9,0:16:51.45,0:16:53.58,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,才没有啦
Dialogue: 8,0:16:51.45,0:16:53.58,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,そんなことねえし
Dialogue: 9,0:16:53.58,0:16:55.49,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,还像这样给你添麻烦
Dialogue: 8,0:16:53.58,0:16:55.49,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,こんな迷惑もかけて
Dialogue: 9,0:16:55.49,0:16:57.50,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,明明你都告诫过我危险的
Dialogue: 8,0:16:55.49,0:16:57.50,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,危ないって言ってくれたのに
Dialogue: 9,0:16:57.50,0:16:58.79,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,真没出息
Dialogue: 8,0:16:57.50,0:16:58.79,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,情けない
Dialogue: 9,0:17:00.21,0:17:03.92,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你会独自出来都是为了我们啊
Dialogue: 8,0:17:00.21,0:17:03.92,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長が 1 人で行ったの全部ウチらのためじゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:17:03.92,0:17:06.55,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,为了让我们不用冒险
Dialogue: 8,0:17:03.92,0:17:06.55,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチらが危なくないようにって
Dialogue: 9,0:17:06.55,0:17:08.30,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,但是  这下我放心了
Dialogue: 8,0:17:06.55,0:17:08.30,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,でも　ちょっと安心した
Dialogue: 9,0:17:08.97,0:17:11.76,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我还以为你变了呢
Dialogue: 8,0:17:08.97,0:17:11.76,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,委員長マジ変わったって思ってた
Dialogue: 9,0:17:12.47,0:17:17.10,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,但是  那个爱哭爱笑的班长一点都没有变啊
Dialogue: 8,0:17:12.47,0:17:17.10,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,でも　よく泣いて笑ってた委員長　マジで変わってないんだって
Dialogue: 9,0:17:17.72,0:17:19.98,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你还是那么泪点低啊
Dialogue: 8,0:17:17.72,0:17:19.98,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,昔から涙もろかったじゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:17:20.60,0:17:22.60,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,変了的人是你吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:20.60,0:17:22.60,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,変わったのはさざんかだろう？
Dialogue: 9,0:17:23.23,0:17:24.27,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:23.23,0:17:24.27,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチが？
Dialogue: 9,0:17:24.27,0:17:26.23,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你这社牛一样的气场
Dialogue: 8,0:17:24.27,0:17:26.23,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,その陽キャって感じで
Dialogue: 9,0:17:26.23,0:17:29.53,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,搞得我没法像过去一样向你搭话了
Dialogue: 8,0:17:26.23,0:17:29.53,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,前みたいに自分が話しかけていい雰囲気じゃなかった
Dialogue: 9,0:17:29.53,0:17:31.66,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,说什么呢  才没有啊
Dialogue: 8,0:17:29.53,0:17:31.66,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マッ？そんなことねえし
Dialogue: 9,0:17:31.66,0:17:32.70,Text - CN,Ayame,1000,0,0,,有罪
Dialogue: 8,0:17:31.66,0:17:32.70,Text - JP,Ayame,1000,0,0,,ギルティ
Dialogue: 9,0:17:32.70,0:17:34.24,Text - CN,Ayame,1000,0,0,,你给我的就是这种感觉
Dialogue: 8,0:17:32.70,0:17:34.24,Text - JP,Ayame,1000,0,0,,そういう印象だ
Dialogue: 9,0:17:34.24,0:17:36.16,Text - CN,Ayame,1000,0,0,,变得会穿衣打扮  变得可爱
Dialogue: 8,0:17:34.24,0:17:36.16,Text - JP,Ayame,1000,0,0,,おしゃれになって　かわいくなって
Dialogue: 9,0:17:36.16,0:17:37.41,Text - CN,Ayame,1000,0,0,,还迷上了户外运动
Dialogue: 8,0:17:36.16,0:17:37.41,Text - JP,Ayame,1000,0,0,,アウトドアにもハマって
Dialogue: 9,0:17:37.41,0:17:39.25,Text - CN,Ayame,1000,0,0,,和过去判若两人了
Dialogue: 8,0:17:37.41,0:17:39.25,Text - JP,Ayame,1000,0,0,,どんどん変わっていった
Dialogue: 9,0:17:39.25,0:17:41.04,Text - CN,Ayame,1000,0,0,,而我却没有改变
Dialogue: 8,0:17:39.25,0:17:41.04,Text - JP,Ayame,1000,0,0,,自分は変わらなかったし
Dialogue: 9,0:17:41.04,0:17:42.58,Text - CN,Ayame,1000,0,0,,朋友也变少了…
Dialogue: 8,0:17:41.04,0:17:42.58,Text - JP,Ayame,1000,0,0,,友達も減っていったのに…
Dialogue: 9,0:17:42.58,0:17:45.79,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,而且  我就没当过班长啊
Dialogue: 8,0:17:42.58,0:17:45.79,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,それに　自分は委員長じゃなかったじゃないか
Dialogue: 9,0:17:52.13,0:17:54.64,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,为什么要叫我班长啊？
Dialogue: 8,0:17:52.13,0:17:54.64,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,なんで　委員長って呼ぶんだ？
Dialogue: 9,0:17:54.64,0:17:58.47,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我也不知道该怎么称呼你…
Dialogue: 8,0:17:54.64,0:17:58.47,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチも　どう呼んだらいいとか　わかんなくて…
Dialogue: 9,0:17:58.47,0:18:02.60,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,你头脑聪明  出于尊重  我就…
Dialogue: 8,0:17:58.47,0:18:02.60,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,だから　マジ頭いいの　リスペクトってえか　その…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.07,Text - CN,Ayame,0,400,0,,阿梅…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.07,Text - CN,Sazanka,600,0,0,,鸢尾…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.07,Text - JP,Ayame,0,400,0,,さっち…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.07,Text - JP,Sazanka,600,0,0,,あやめ…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:12.32,0:18:13.66,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真是笑死！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:12.32,0:18:13.66,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ草！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:13.66,0:18:16.95,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,但是我觉得我们的队长非你不可
Dialogue: 8,0:18:13.66,0:18:16.95,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,でもあやめしかリーダーはいないってマジ思ってる
Dialogue: 9,0:18:16.95,0:18:19.41,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,要取代百合可不容易
Dialogue: 8,0:18:16.95,0:18:19.41,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ゆりの代わりは荷が重い
Dialogue: 9,0:18:19.41,0:18:21.79,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,我不像她那样坚强
Dialogue: 8,0:18:19.41,0:18:21.79,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,自分はゆりほど強くないんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:18:21.79,0:18:25.46,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,那等你要崩溃的时候就来跟我讲
Dialogue: 8,0:18:21.79,0:18:25.46,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,じゃあさマジメンブレのときはウチに話して
Dialogue: 9,0:18:25.46,0:18:28.17,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我会支持鸢尾… 支持你的！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:25.46,0:18:28.17,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,ウチがあやめを…　あやめを支える！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:28.17,0:18:28.88,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 8,0:18:28.17,0:18:28.88,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,うん
Dialogue: 9,0:18:28.88,0:18:30.80,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,谢谢  阿梅
Dialogue: 8,0:18:28.88,0:18:30.80,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ありがとう　さっち
Dialogue: 9,0:18:30.80,0:18:32.72,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,这下我就能继续努力了
Dialogue: 8,0:18:30.80,0:18:32.72,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,それなら自分も頑張れる
Dialogue: 9,0:18:33.01,0:18:35.26,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我们真是金石之交
Dialogue: 8,0:18:33.01,0:18:35.26,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ金石の交わり
Dialogue: 9,0:18:35.26,0:18:37.68,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,怎么又说些难懂的词
Dialogue: 8,0:18:35.26,0:18:37.68,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,また難しい言葉を使う
Dialogue: 9,0:18:39.85,0:18:41.56,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,雪一时半会也不会停
Dialogue: 8,0:18:39.85,0:18:41.56,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,雪収まんねえし
Dialogue: 9,0:18:41.56,0:18:43.19,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真希望能生火啊
Dialogue: 8,0:18:41.56,0:18:43.19,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,火があればいいんだけど
Dialogue: 9,0:18:43.19,0:18:44.90,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,这有点困难吧…
Dialogue: 8,0:18:43.19,0:18:44.90,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,それはさすがに…
Dialogue: 9,0:18:45.31,0:18:46.65,Text - CN,Ayame; Sazanka,0,0,0,,我们有火啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:18:45.31,0:18:46.65,Text - JP,Ayame; Sazanka,0,0,0,,あるじゃん！{*あるぞ！}
Comment: 9,0:18:48.15,0:18:50.57,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,(安德瓦里,Andvari)  展开！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:48.15,0:18:50.57,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,安德瓦里  展开！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:48.15,0:18:50.57,RUBY,Ayame,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(864,965)}Andvari
Dialogue: 8,0:18:48.15,0:18:50.57,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,アンドヴァリ・エクステンド！
Dialogue: 9,0:18:56.28,0:18:57.95,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真暖和
Dialogue: 8,0:18:56.28,0:18:57.95,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジあったか～い
Comment: 9,0:18:57.95,0:19:00.99,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,毕竟它可是能烧化(狂猎,Wild Hunt)的装甲
Dialogue: 9,0:18:57.95,0:19:00.99,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,毕竟它可是能烧化狂猎的装甲
Dialogue: 9,0:18:57.95,0:19:00.99,RUBY,Ayame,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1098,965)}Wild Hunt
Dialogue: 8,0:18:57.95,0:19:00.99,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ワイルドハントの装甲を焼き切るからな
Comment: 9,0:19:01.33,0:19:04.46,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,但是  光靠(苏尔特,Surtr)也撑不了多久
Dialogue: 9,0:19:01.33,0:19:04.46,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,但是  光靠苏尔特也撑不了多久
Dialogue: 9,0:19:01.33,0:19:04.46,RUBY,Ayame,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(917,965)}Surtr
Dialogue: 8,0:19:01.33,0:19:04.46,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,だけど　スルトだけじゃもたなかったと思う
Dialogue: 9,0:19:05.04,0:19:06.71,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,那正好有我在啊
Dialogue: 8,0:19:05.04,0:19:06.71,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,なら　来てよかった
Dialogue: 9,0:19:16.64,0:19:18.89,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,电力恢复了  但是…
Dialogue: 8,0:19:16.64,0:19:18.89,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,電気は戻ったが…
Dialogue: 9,0:19:19.18,0:19:21.89,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,有小梅在  一定没事的
Dialogue: 8,0:19:19.18,0:19:21.89,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,さんちゃんがいるから　きっと大丈夫
Dialogue: 9,0:19:21.89,0:19:23.43,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,我们回来了！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:21.89,0:19:23.43,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,たっだいま～！
Dialogue: 9,0:19:23.43,0:19:24.27,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 8,0:19:23.43,0:19:24.27,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,おつ～
Dialogue: 9,0:19:24.27,0:19:26.65,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,小鸢  小梅！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:24.27,0:19:26.65,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,あやちゃん　さんちゃん！
Dialogue: 9,0:19:26.65,0:19:28.86,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,抱歉  让你们担心了
Dialogue: 8,0:19:26.65,0:19:28.86,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,すまない　心配をかけた
Dialogue: 9,0:19:28.86,0:19:30.15,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 8,0:19:28.86,0:19:30.15,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,あらあら
Dialogue: 9,0:19:30.65,0:19:33.78,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,需要大姐姐的在感冒时的人生智慧吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:19:30.65,0:19:33.78,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,風邪ひいたときのおねえちゃんの知恵袋いる？
Dialogue: 9,0:19:34.19,0:19:35.82,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,需要上 buff 吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:19:34.19,0:19:35.82,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,バフ入れる？
Dialogue: 9,0:19:35.82,0:19:37.57,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,不  不用了
Dialogue: 8,0:19:35.82,0:19:37.57,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,だ　大丈夫だ
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.57,0:19:39.66,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,多亏阿梅救了我
Dialogue: 8,0:19:37.57,0:19:39.66,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,さっちに助けられたから
Dialogue: 9,0:19:39.66,0:19:42.33,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,还不是因为你自己逞强
Dialogue: 8,0:19:39.66,0:19:42.33,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,あやめがマジむちゃしてくれたからじゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:19:42.99,0:19:45.08,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,喝这个暖暖身子
Dialogue: 8,0:19:42.99,0:19:45.08,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,これであったまってください
Dialogue: 9,0:19:45.79,0:19:47.04,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 8,0:19:45.79,0:19:47.04,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,サンキュ
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.79,0:19:50.38,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,莲莲  真的谢谢你
Dialogue: 8,0:19:47.79,0:19:50.38,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,れんれんさ　マジサンキュ
Dialogue: 9,0:19:50.38,0:19:51.55,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,最后搞定了
Dialogue: 8,0:19:50.38,0:19:51.55,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,なんとかなったし
Dialogue: 9,0:19:51.55,0:19:52.75,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 8,0:19:51.55,0:19:52.75,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,よかった
Dialogue: 9,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.51,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,莲莲  要做之前说的那个吗
Dialogue: 8,0:19:53.17,0:19:55.51,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,れんれん　さっきのやつやろっか
Dialogue: 9,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.59,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,之前说的？
Dialogue: 8,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.59,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,さっきの？
Dialogue: 9,0:19:57.59,0:19:59.59,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,啊  没问题！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:57.59,0:19:59.59,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,あっ　わかりました！
Dialogue: 9,0:19:59.59,0:20:04.35,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,在明明是春天却下暴风雪的寒冷日子里！
Dialogue: 8,0:19:59.59,0:20:04.35,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,春なのに　吹雪になってマジヤバいくらい寒い日に！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:04.81,0:20:07.56,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,让人从内暖到外的割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:04.81,0:20:07.56,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,体の芯からあったまる割烹！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:07.56,0:20:09.06,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:07.56,0:20:09.06,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,割烹！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:09.06,0:20:10.19,Text - CN,Ayame,1200,0,0,,割烹!?
Dialogue: 8,0:20:09.06,0:20:10.19,Text - JP,Ayame,1200,0,0,,割烹!?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:10.19,0:20:13.28,Text - CN,All,0,0,0,,废墟三分钟简单割烹！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:10.19,0:20:13.28,Text - JP,All,0,0,0,,廃墟 3 分簡単かっぽ～！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.32,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,要准备的食材如下
Dialogue: 8,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.32,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,用意するものはこちらになります
Dialogue: 9,0:20:16.32,0:20:20.24,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,把橄榄油和咸牛肉还有玉米放入锅中翻炒
Dialogue: 8,0:20:16.32,0:20:20.24,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,オリーブオイルに　コンビーフ　コーンを入れて炒めていきます
Dialogue: 9,0:20:20.74,0:20:21.58,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,有罪！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:20.74,0:20:21.58,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,ギルティ！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:21.58,0:20:22.70,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,要炒糊了
Dialogue: 8,0:20:21.58,0:20:22.70,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,焦げそうだ
Dialogue: 9,0:20:22.70,0:20:26.08,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,炒得略焦一点更好吃
Dialogue: 8,0:20:22.70,0:20:26.08,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,香ばしい風味がついてもっとおいしくなるんです
Dialogue: 9,0:20:26.08,0:20:27.87,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,真是香气扑鼻啊
Dialogue: 8,0:20:26.08,0:20:27.87,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジ　香気芬々じゃん
Dialogue: 9,0:20:28.17,0:20:30.50,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,接下来煮拉面
Dialogue: 8,0:20:28.17,0:20:30.50,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,次はラーメンを作りま～す
Dialogue: 9,0:20:30.50,0:20:33.00,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,楠姐  你要放叉烧的对吧
Dialogue: 8,0:20:30.50,0:20:33.00,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,えりねえ　チャーシュー盛るよな
Dialogue: 9,0:20:33.00,0:20:35.42,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,小雏要双倍豆芽菜哦
Dialogue: 8,0:20:33.00,0:20:35.42,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,ひなちゃんは　もやしマシマシね
Dialogue: 9,0:20:35.71,0:20:38.18,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,青葱要多放才好吃
Dialogue: 8,0:20:35.71,0:20:38.18,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,おねぎはドンドン入れるとおいしいです
Dialogue: 9,0:20:38.47,0:20:40.97,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,蒜泥和姜蓉看个人喜好
Dialogue: 8,0:20:38.47,0:20:40.97,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,にんにくしょうがはお好みです
Dialogue: 9,0:20:41.39,0:20:45.02,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,要是多放点  做出来的味道就和餐馆很像了
Dialogue: 8,0:20:41.39,0:20:45.02,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,入れ過ぎ割烹すると　お店の味に近くなるんです
Dialogue: 9,0:20:51.02,0:20:53.48,Text - CN,All,0,0,0,,我开动了！
Dialogue: 8,0:20:51.02,0:20:53.48,Text - JP,All,0,0,0,,いただきま～す！
Dialogue: 9,0:20:56.49,0:20:59.03,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,昨天的大雪就像骗人的一样
Dialogue: 8,0:20:56.49,0:20:59.03,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,昨日の雪がウソみたい
Dialogue: 9,0:20:59.32,0:21:04.08,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,那么  我们把学校作为临时据点开始准备吧
Dialogue: 8,0:20:59.32,0:21:04.08,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,さて　それじゃあ　あの学校を一時的な拠点としつつ準備をしよう
Dialogue: 9,0:21:04.08,0:21:05.33,Text - CN,Erika,800,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:04.08,0:21:05.33,Text - JP,Erika,800,0,0,,は～い
Dialogue: 9,0:21:05.33,0:21:07.83,Text - CN,Erika,800,0,0,,我觉得没问题
Dialogue: 8,0:21:05.33,0:21:07.83,Text - JP,Erika,800,0,0,,おねえちゃん　いいわよ　いいわよ
Dialogue: 9,0:21:05.70,0:21:07.83,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,600,0,,不要背我啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:05.70,0:21:07.83,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,600,0,,え～い　おんぶをやめろ～！
Dialogue: 9,0:21:07.83,0:21:09.16,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,OK 哟！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:07.83,0:21:09.16,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,オケマル！
Dialogue: 9,0:21:09.16,0:21:11.75,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,那么鸢尾  我们要先做什么？
Dialogue: 8,0:21:09.16,0:21:11.75,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,じゃああやめ　何からすればいい？
Dialogue: 9,0:21:11.75,0:21:13.38,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,首先是食物
Dialogue: 8,0:21:11.75,0:21:13.38,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,まずは食べ物だな
Dialogue: 9,0:21:13.38,0:21:14.96,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,割烹需要食物
Dialogue: 8,0:21:13.38,0:21:14.96,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,割烹に必要だ
Dialogue: 9,0:21:14.96,0:21:15.92,Text - CN,Sazanka,0,0,0,,就是说啊！
Dialogue: 8,0:21:14.96,0:21:15.92,Text - JP,Sazanka,0,0,0,,マジそれな！
Dialogue: 9,0:21:15.92,0:21:17.59,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,真随便啊
Dialogue: 8,0:21:15.92,0:21:17.59,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,適当だな
Dialogue: 9,0:21:24.22,0:21:25.39,Text - CN,Ayame,0,0,0,,你没事吧!?
Dialogue: 8,0:21:24.22,0:21:25.39,Text - JP,Ayame,0,0,0,,大丈夫か!?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:26.56,0:21:27.93,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,嗯  嗯…
Dialogue: 8,0:21:26.56,0:21:27.93,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,う　うん…
Dialogue: 9,0:21:29.60,0:21:32.23,Text - CN - top,Renge,0,0,0,,刚刚… 突然没有力气了…
Dialogue: 8,0:21:29.60,0:21:32.23,Text - JP - top,Renge,0,0,0,,今… 力が抜けた…
Dialogue: 9,0:21:37.19,0:21:40.28,Text - CN,Renge,0,0,0,,没事的… 吧？
Dialogue: 8,0:21:37.19,0:21:40.28,Text - JP,Renge,0,0,0,,大丈夫だよ… ね？
Dialogue: 9,0:23:11.29,0:23:12.66,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,小雏！
Dialogue: 8,0:23:11.29,0:23:12.66,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,ひなちゃーん！
Dialogue: 9,0:23:12.66,0:23:14.04,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,你一定很冷吧
Dialogue: 8,0:23:12.66,0:23:14.04,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,寒かったわね
Dialogue: 9,0:23:14.04,0:23:16.62,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,让我来紧紧抱住你吧
Dialogue: 8,0:23:14.04,0:23:16.62,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃんがぎゅーっとしてあげるわね
Dialogue: 9,0:23:16.62,0:23:17.83,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,快住手  楠姐！
Dialogue: 8,0:23:16.62,0:23:17.83,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,やめろ　えりねえ！
Dialogue: 9,0:23:17.83,0:23:18.67,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,已经放晴了
Dialogue: 8,0:23:17.83,0:23:18.67,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,もう晴れてんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:23:18.67,0:23:20.21,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,你怀抱的攻击范围也太大了吧
Dialogue: 8,0:23:18.67,0:23:20.21,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,抱きついてくる間合いが広い
Dialogue: 9,0:23:20.21,0:23:21.76,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,你这是指令投吗？
Dialogue: 8,0:23:20.21,0:23:21.76,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,コマンド投げかよ
Dialogue: 9,0:23:21.05,0:23:22.09,Text - CN,Erika,800,0,0,,哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 8,0:23:21.05,0:23:22.09,Text - JP,Erika,800,0,0,,あらあら
Dialogue: 9,0:23:22.09,0:23:23.63,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀个头啊
Dialogue: 8,0:23:22.09,0:23:23.63,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,あらあらあらじゃねえ
Dialogue: 9,0:23:23.63,0:23:27.18,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,我之后找食物时还得顺便寻找游戏
Dialogue: 8,0:23:23.63,0:23:27.18,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,ひな的にはこれから食べ物探すついでにゲーム探すんだ
Dialogue: 9,0:23:27.18,0:23:28.97,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,我也一起来帮你找吧
Dialogue: 8,0:23:27.18,0:23:28.97,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃんも一緒に探すわね
Dialogue: 9,0:23:28.97,0:23:30.64,Text - CN,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,你又不懂游戏吧
Dialogue: 8,0:23:28.97,0:23:30.64,Text - JP,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,えりねえゲームわかんねえだろ
Dialogue: 9,0:23:30.64,0:23:31.43,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 8,0:23:30.64,0:23:31.43,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,あら
Dialogue: 9,0:23:31.81,0:23:34.39,Text - CN,Erika,0,0,0,,大姐姐的人生智慧  下一集
Dialogue: 8,0:23:31.81,0:23:34.39,Text - JP,Erika,0,0,0,,おねえちゃんの知恵袋だけど次回は
Dialogue: 9,0:23:34.39,0:23:39.19,Text - CN - top,Erika; Hinageshi,0,0,0,,用鲭鱼与牡蛎做的切蒲英风鸡蛋烩饭传达思念
Dialogue: 8,0:23:34.39,0:23:39.19,Text - JP - top,Erika; Hinageshi,0,0,0,,思いを伝えてサバと牡蠣の卵雑炊　崩しきりたんぽ風
Dialogue: 9,0:23:39.19,0:23:40.11,Text - CN - top,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,不要抢跑啊
Dialogue: 8,0:23:39.19,0:23:40.11,Text - JP - top,Hinageshi,0,0,0,,フライングすんな
Dialogue: 9,0:23:40.11,0:23:40.90,Text - CN - top,Erika,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 8,0:23:40.11,0:23:40.90,Text - JP - top,Erika,0,0,0,,あらあら
Comment: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,~Karaoke~
